        "custom_liquid_t6Ur93": {
          "type": "custom_liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"nuvira-guarantee-box\">\n  <div class=\"nuvira-guarantee-icon\">\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" class=\"nuvira-medal-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <path d=\"M22 38V60L32 53L42 60V38\" fill=\"#D7C09A\"/>\n      <circle cx=\"32\" cy=\"24\" r=\"18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#D7C09A\" stroke-width=\"5\"/>\n      <circle cx=\"32\" cy=\"24\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#D7C09A\"/>\n    </svg>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"nuvira-guarantee-content\">\n    <h3>Garantía de satisfacción 30 días</h3>\n    <p>\n      Prueba NMN+ de Nuvira Lab sin riesgo. Si no estás satisfecho con tu compra durante los primeros 30 días, puedes solicitar la devolución de forma sencilla.\n      <br>\n      Sin formularios eternos. Sin complicaciones. Compra protegida desde el primer pedido.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n  .nuvira-guarantee-box {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    gap: 16px;\n    width: 100%;\n    padding: 16px 20px;\n    border: 1.5px solid #D7C09A;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    background: rgba(215, 192, 154, 0.10);\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    margin: 18px 0;\n  }\n\n  .nuvira-guarantee-icon {\n    width: 58px;\n    min-width: 58px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    justify-content: center;\n    padding-top: 2px;\n  }\n\n  .nuvira-medal-icon {\n    width: 52px;\n    height: 52px;\n    display: block;\n  }\n\n  .nuvira-guarantee-content h3 {\n    margin: 0 0 4px 0;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    line-height: 1.25;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: #1A1A1A;\n    letter-spacing: 0.3px;\n  }\n\n  .nuvira-guarantee-content p {\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.45;\n    color: #1A1A1A;\n    letter-spacing: 0.2px;\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 600px) {\n    .nuvira-guarantee-box {\n      gap: 12px;\n      padding: 14px 14px;\n    }\n\n    .nuvira-guarantee-icon {\n      width: 46px;\n      min-width: 46px;\n    }\n\n    .nuvira-medal-icon {\n      width: 42px;\n      height: 42px;\n    }\n\n    .nuvira-guarantee-content h3 {\n      font-size: 16px;\n    }\n\n    .nuvira-guarantee-content p {\n      font-size: 14px;\n    }\n  }\n</style>"
          }
        },
        "custom_liquid_YHectY": {
          "type": "custom_liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "<section class=\"nuvira-faq-section\">\n  <div class=\"nuvira-faq-container\">\n\n    <details class=\"nuvira-faq-item\">\n      <summary>\n        <span>Nuestro sistema único</span>\n        <span class=\"nuvira-faq-plus\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div class=\"nuvira-faq-content\">\n        <p>\n          NMN+ de Nuvira Lab combina en una sola fórmula NMN, Resveratrol, Quercetina y TMG. Una rutina 4 en 1 pensada para apoyar la energía celular, la vitalidad diaria y el bienestar desde dentro, sin tener que tomar varios suplementos por separado.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </details>\n\n    <details class=\"nuvira-faq-item\">\n      <summary>\n        <span>Cómo tomarlo</span>\n        <span class=\"nuvira-faq-plus\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div class=\"nuvira-faq-content\">\n        <p>\n          Toma 2 cápsulas al día, preferiblemente por la mañana junto con un vaso de agua. Para mejores resultados, incorpóralo como parte de una rutina diaria constante.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </details>\n\n    <details class=\"nuvira-faq-item\">\n      <summary>\n        <span>Ingredientes</span>\n        <span class=\"nuvira-faq-plus\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div class=\"nuvira-faq-content\">\n        <p>\n          Su fórmula combina NMN, Resveratrol, Quercetina y TMG. Una selección de ingredientes enfocada en apoyar la energía celular, el envejecimiento saludable, la vitalidad y el bienestar diario.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </details>\n\n    <details class=\"nuvira-faq-item\">\n      <summary>\n        <span>Garantía de satisfacción 30 días</span>\n        <span class=\"nuvira-faq-plus\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div class=\"nuvira-faq-content\">\n        <p>\n          Prueba NMN+ de Nuvira Lab sin riesgo. Si no estás satisfecho con tu compra durante los primeros 30 días, puedes solicitar la devolución de forma sencilla. Sin formularios eternos. Sin complicaciones.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </details>\n\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<style>\n  .nuvira-faq-section {\n    width: 100%;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    padding: 24px 20px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    font-family: inherit;\n  }\n\n  .nuvira-faq-container {\n    max-width: 900px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n\n  .nuvira-faq-item {\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #111111;\n  }\n\n  .nuvira-faq-item:first-child {\n    border-top: none;\n  }\n\n  .nuvira-faq-item summary {\n    list-style: none;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    padding: 22px 0;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    gap: 20px;\n    color: #111111;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    line-height: 1.25;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    letter-spacing: 0.6px;\n  }\n\n  .nuvira-faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker {\n    display: none;\n  }\n\n  .nuvira-faq-plus {\n    font-size: 26px;\n    line-height: 1;\n    font-weight: 300;\n    color: #111111;\n    transition: transform 0.25s ease;\n  }\n\n  .nuvira-faq-item[open] .nuvira-faq-plus {\n    transform: rotate(45deg);\n    color: #D7C09A;\n  }\n\n  .nuvira-faq-content {\n    padding: 0 0 22px 0;\n    max-width: 820px;\n  }\n\n  .nuvira-faq-content p {\n    margin: 0;\n    color: #333333;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.65;\n    letter-spacing: 0.3px;\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 768px) {\n    .nuvira-faq-section {\n      padding: 18px 16px;\n    }\n\n    .nuvira-faq-item summary {\n      padding: 19px 0;\n      font-size: 19px;\n    }\n\n    .nuvira-faq-plus {\n      font-size: 24px;\n    }\n\n    .nuvira-faq-content p {\n      font-size: 14px;\n      line-height: 1.6;\n    }\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 480px) {\n    .nuvira-faq-section {\n      padding: 14px 14px;\n    }\n\n    .nuvira-faq-item summary {\n      font-size: 17px;\n      letter-spacing: 0.3px;\n    }\n  }\n</style>"
          }
