    "custom_liquid_iJfYjA": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "t:sections.custom-liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "display_id": false,
        "visibility": "always-display",
        "custom_liquid": "<section class=\"nuvira-reviews-section\">\n  <div class=\"nuvira-reviews-header\">\n    <h2>Lo que dicen nuestros clientes</h2>\n    <div class=\"nuvira-reviews-rating\">\n      <span class=\"nuvira-stars\">★★★★★</span>\n      <span>Opiniones de compradores verificados</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"nuvira-reviews-grid\">\n    \n    <div class=\"nuvira-review-card\">\n      <div class=\"nuvira-review-top\">\n        <div class=\"nuvira-avatar\">M</div>\n        <div>\n          <h3>Marta G.</h3>\n          <div class=\"nuvira-card-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n          <p class=\"nuvira-verified\">Compra verificada</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <h4>Más energía en mi rutina</h4>\n      <p class=\"nuvira-review-text\">\n        \"Lo empecé a tomar porque últimamente me notaba con menos energía durante el día. Me gusta que sea una fórmula completa y que solo tenga que tomar 2 cápsulas al día.\"\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"nuvira-review-card\">\n      <div class=\"nuvira-review-top\">\n        <div class=\"nuvira-avatar\">C</div>\n        <div>\n          <h3>Carlos R.</h3>\n          <div class=\"nuvira-card-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n          <p class=\"nuvira-verified\">Compra verificada</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <h4>Fórmula muy completa</h4>\n      <p class=\"nuvira-review-text\">\n        \"Buscaba NMN, pero me convenció que también llevara resveratrol, quercetina y TMG. Es fácil de incorporar por la mañana y el formato de 60 cápsulas me parece muy cómodo.\"\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"nuvira-review-card\">\n      <div class=\"nuvira-review-top\">\n        <div class=\"nuvira-avatar\">L</div>\n        <div>\n          <h3>Laura P.</h3>\n          <div class=\"nuvira-card-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n          <p class=\"nuvira-verified\">Compra verificada</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <h4>Perfecto para empezar el día</h4>\n      <p class=\"nuvira-review-text\">\n        \"Lo tomo por la mañana junto con el desayuno. Me gusta porque no es una rutina complicada y encaja muy bien si quieres cuidar tu energía celular y rendimiento diario.\"\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<style>\n  .nuvira-reviews-section {\n    width: 100%;\n    background: #D7C09A;\n    padding: 70px 20px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    font-family: inherit;\n  }\n\n  .nuvira-reviews-header {\n    text-align: center;\n    max-width: 900px;\n    margin: 0 auto 46px auto;\n  }\n\n  .nuvira-reviews-header h2 {\n    color: #111111;\n    font-size: 38px;\n    line-height: 1.15;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    margin: 0 0 14px 0;\n    letter-spacing: -0.5px;\n  }\n\n  .nuvira-reviews-rating {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 10px;\n    color: #111111;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n\n  .nuvira-stars {\n    color: #ffffff;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    font-size: 17px;\n  }\n\n  .nuvira-reviews-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    gap: 30px;\n    max-width: 1200px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n\n  .nuvira-review-card {\n    background: #ffffff;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    padding: 32px 26px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    min-height: 245px;\n    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);\n  }\n\n  .nuvira-review-top {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 14px;\n    margin-bottom: 18px;\n  }\n\n  .nuvira-avatar {\n    width: 58px;\n    height: 58px;\n    min-width: 58px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #D7C09A;\n    color: #111111;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n  }\n\n  .nuvira-review-card h3 {\n    margin: 0 0 4px 0;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n\n  .nuvira-card-stars {\n    color: #111111;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    line-height: 1;\n    margin-bottom: 5px;\n  }\n\n  .nuvira-verified {\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: #555555;\n    position: relative;\n    padding-left: 16px;\n  }\n\n  .nuvira-verified::before {\n    content: \"✓\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    top: 0;\n    color: #D7C09A;\n    font-weight: 900;\n  }\n\n  .nuvira-review-card h4 {\n    margin: 0 0 10px 0;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    line-height: 1.25;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n\n  .nuvira-review-text {\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.45;\n    color: #444444;\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 900px) {\n    .nuvira-reviews-section {\n      padding: 54px 18px;\n    }\n\n    .nuvira-reviews-grid {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n      gap: 18px;\n      max-width: 520px;\n    }\n\n    .nuvira-reviews-header {\n      margin-bottom: 32px;\n    }\n\n    .nuvira-reviews-header h2 {\n      font-size: 30px;\n    }\n\n    .nuvira-review-card {\n      padding: 26px 22px;\n      min-height: auto;\n    }\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 480px) {\n    .nuvira-reviews-section {\n      padding: 46px 14px;\n    }\n\n    .nuvira-reviews-header h2 {\n      font-size: 26px;\n    }\n\n    .nuvira-reviews-rating {\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 5px;\n      font-size: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .nuvira-review-card {\n      padding: 24px 20px;\n    }\n\n    .nuvira-avatar {\n      width: 52px;\n      height: 52px;\n      min-width: 52px;\n      font-size: 20px;\n    }\n\n    .nuvira-review-text {\n      font-size: 14px;\n    }\n  }\n</style>",
        "color_scheme": "background-1",
