        "custom_liquid": "<section class=\"nuvira-benefit-strip\">\n  <div class=\"nuvira-benefit-inner\">\n\n    <div class=\"nuvira-benefit-item\">\n      <div class=\"nuvira-benefit-icon\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <circle cx=\"32\" cy=\"32\" r=\"19\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"32\" cy=\"32\" r=\"6\" fill=\"currentColor\"/>\n          <path d=\"M32 7v8M32 49v8M7 32h8M49 32h8M15 15l6 6M43 43l6 6M49 15l-6 6M21 43l-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n          <path d=\"M35 20l-10 14h8l-4 10 11-16h-8l3-8z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n      <p>Apoyo a la energía celular durante el día</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"nuvira-benefit-item\">\n      <div class=\"nuvira-benefit-icon\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"22\" r=\"7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"46\" cy=\"22\" r=\"7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"32\" cy=\"44\" r=\"7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n          <path d=\"M24 25l16 0M22 28l7 11M42 28l-7 11\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"22\" r=\"2\" fill=\"currentColor\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"46\" cy=\"22\" r=\"2\" fill=\"currentColor\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"32\" cy=\"44\" r=\"2\" fill=\"currentColor\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n      <p>Fórmula 4 en 1: NMN + Resveratrol + Quercetina + TMG</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"nuvira-benefit-item\">\n      <div class=\"nuvira-benefit-icon\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <rect x=\"16\" y=\"25\" width=\"32\" height=\"15\" rx=\"7.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n          <path d=\"M32 25v15\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n          <rect x=\"23\" y=\"12\" width=\"18\" height=\"34\" rx=\"9\" transform=\"rotate(-35 32 29)\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n          <path d=\"M24 20l16 23\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n      <p>60 cápsulas — rutina simple de 2 cápsulas al día</p>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<style>\n  .nuvira-benefit-strip {\n    width: 100vw;\n    margin-left: calc(50% - 50vw);\n    background: #EEF1F5;\n    padding: 26px 20px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    font-family: inherit;\n  }\n\n  .nuvira-benefit-inner {\n    max-width: 1050px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 42px;\n  }\n\n  .nuvira-benefit-item {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 16px;\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n\n  .nuvira-benefit-icon {\n    width: 46px;\n    min-width: 46px;\n    height: 46px;\n    color: #D7C09A;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n\n  .nuvira-benefit-icon svg {\n    width: 46px;\n    height: 46px;\n    display: block;\n  }\n\n  .nuvira-benefit-item p {\n    margin: 0;\n    color: #111111;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    letter-spacing: 0.6px;\n    max-width: 285px;\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 900px) {\n    .nuvira-benefit-inner {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n      gap: 22px;\n      max-width: 520px;\n    }\n\n    .nuvira-benefit-item {\n      justify-content: flex-start;\n    }\n\n    .nuvira-benefit-strip {\n      padding: 28px 22px;\n    }\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 480px) {\n    .nuvira-benefit-strip {\n      padding: 24px 18px;\n    }\n\n    .nuvira-benefit-item {\n      gap: 14px;\n    }\n\n    .nuvira-benefit-icon {\n      width: 40px;\n      min-width: 40px;\n      height: 40px;\n    }\n\n    .nuvira-benefit-icon svg {\n      width: 40px;\n      height: 40px;\n    }\n\n    .nuvira-benefit-item p {\n      font-size: 14px;\n      letter-spacing: 0.4px;\n    }\n  }\n</style>",
